      "case": "tall_grass_hide_and_capture",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "observed": "Meadow rows 13-26 painted as tall grass (165 tiles). First Apply used CTRMap-F5's TALL_GRASS tuple 0600183d and the player could not step onto it; retail tall grass is 04400020 (Route 102; 59 of 857 retail regions), set after the Apply. Then: walking in grass works, grass tufts at the player's and Mew's feet, no wild encounter during the whole chase. Mew hides after flees 1-3 (tuft visible), pops out when approached, stays visible at the cornered spot; talk -> '¡Mew no tiene adónde huir!' -> Mew Lv 30 battle -> Master Ball capture -> box 1. In-game save: flag 3031 = 1, 3034 = 1, work 16667 = 5, work 16697 = 0.",
